    "resumen": "Igualamos $f'=0$ y encontramos donde $f'$ no existe.",
    "pasos": [
     "$f'(x)=\\frac{4}{3}x^{1/3}(x-7)^2+x^{4/3}\\cdot 2(x-7)$",
